<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="cards four" data-stagger><article class="card rv town-card"><a class="ph" href="/vermont-towns/burlington/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snowy-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snowy-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snowy-street.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="908" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="in"><span class="meta">Chittenden County</span><h2><a href="/vermont-towns/burlington/">Burlington</a></h2><p>Vermont’s largest city sits on the eastern shore of Lake Champlain, with a housing mix that runs from…</p><a class="more" href="/vermont-towns/burlington/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">Local page →</a></div></article><article class="card rv town-card"><a class="ph" href="/vermont-towns/south-burlington/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/condo-building-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/condo-building.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="in"><span class="meta">Chittenden County</span><h2><a href="/vermont-towns/south-burlington/">South Burlington</a></h2><p>South Burlington’s condos, townhouses and suburban homes surround Burlington International Airport and the…</p><a class="more" href="/vermont-towns/south-burlington/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">Local page →</a></div></article><article class="card rv town-card"><a class="ph" href="/vermont-towns/rutland/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/foliage-valley.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/foliage-valley-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/foliage-valley.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, (max-width:1020px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="in"